15hl|n|A kitten. ; A small violin. ; A large bottle. ; A wooden tub or pail, smaller at the top than at the bottom; as, a kit of butter, or of mackerel. ; straw or rush basket for fish; also, any kind of basket. ; A box for working implements; hence, a working outfit, as of a workman, a soldier, and the like. ; A group of separate parts, things, or individuals; -- used with whole, and generally contemptuously; as, the whole kit of them.	a:eds,56,4;287q,53,4;eld,32,2~287q,53,4;eds,56,4;eld,32,2	v:16xg,42,7;287q,33,1~16xg,42,7;287q,33,1	n:m68,92,32;2bln,91,4;r7b,81,1;fuf,80,8;287q,68,11;muq,46,6;gx2,43,5;rcd,37,17;1v85,36,4;1n1m,34,31~m68,92,32;1n1m,34,31;rcd,37,17;287q,68,11;fuf,80,8;muq,46,6;gx2,43,5;2bln,91,4;1v85,36,4;r7b,81,1	N:18ck,52,4~18ck,52,4
